# Market Gnome's second ability needs a craft ability being activated. Bot1 exiles their own Gnome twice. On turn three City of
# Shadows ("{T}, Exile a creature you control: Put a storage counter on this land") exiles it as a cost: an ability is being
# activated, but it is not craft (CR 702.167a), so nothing triggers. On turn five a second Gnome is exiled by Swords to
# Plowshares: no ability is being activated at all. Neither is a death, so the first ability stays quiet: Bot1's life is
# 20 and their hand is only what they drew, both times.

